{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/24860-now-my-niece-has-lead-poisoning","id":24860,"title":"Now my niece has lead poisoning :(","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-06T20:18:51-08:00","id":24860,"title":"Now my niece has lead poisoning :(","content":"Hey guys, I know I posted awhile ago on the old forums about my nephew having lead poisoning from the old house he's living in. Well here is a sad and frustrating update: After two years and thousands of dollars that have been donated to help (thank you everyone who contributed to that!) my sister has been able to make a portion of her house lead safe, but recently my niece, who is only 17 months old, tested high for lead in her blood. My sister was beside herself because she couldn't figure out where the lead was coming from. With some more help from friends and family, she flew in an expert from Lead Safe America, who was able to test the house more extensively. She found out the situation was even worse than she knew. Now they are trying to raise money to renovate even more of the house to make it safe. If they could afford it, they would move, but they can't.<br /> <br /> I'm not here to hit you up for money, though of course I would greatly appreciate anyone who contributed to help my nephew and little niece. If you could help me out just by sharing this story around on your various social networks, that would be the best. And if you pray, meditate, or just keep people in your thoughts, please keep my family in your thoughts.<br /> <br /> Here's the link to the story and the donation page: <a href=\"http://leadsafeamerica.org/?p=1121\" target=\"_blank\">http://leadsafeamerica.org/?p=1121</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://leadsafeamerica.org/?p=1078\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://leadsafeamerica.org/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/kung.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox 